n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <p class=\"prompt\">45. ______ are said to be the world’s best watchmakers.</p>\n      <div class=\"options\">\n        <span class=\"option\">A. Swisses</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">B. The Swisses</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">C. The Swiss</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">D. Swiss</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <p class=\"prompt\">46. The new stadium being built for the next Asian Games will be ______ the present<span class=\"continuation\">one.</span></p>\n      <div class=\"options two-column\">\n        <span class=\"option\">A.as three times big as</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">B. three times as big as</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">C.as big as three times</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">D.as big three times</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <p class=\"prompt\">47. People like to walk by ______ sea in ______ June and July.</p>\n      <div class=\"options\">\n        <span class=\"option\">A. the; /</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">B. /; /</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">C. the; the</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">D. /; the</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <p class=\"prompt\">48. If we sit near ______ front of the bus, we’ll have ______ better view.</p>\n      <div class=\"options\">\n        <span class=\"option\">A. /; the</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">B. /; a</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">C. the; a</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">D. the; the</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <p class=\"prompt\">49. Some people are in ______ habit of saying silly words in ______ public places.</p>\n      <div class=\"options\">\n        <span class=\"option\">A. the; /</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">B. /; the</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">C. the; the</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">D. /; /</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <p class=\"prompt\">50. In China, ______ pressure to pass ______ exams tends to cause lack of students’<span class=\"continuation\">creativity.</span></p>\n      <div class=\"options\">\n        <span class=\"option\">A. /; the</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">B. a; the</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">C. the; /</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">D. /; the</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <p class=\"prompt\">51. It took us quite a long time to get there. It was a ______ Journey.</p>\n      <div class=\"options\">\n        <span class=\"option\">A. three-hours</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">B. three hour</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">C. three-hour</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">D. three hours</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <p class=\"prompt\">52. After watching ______ TV, she played ______ violin for an hour.</p>\n      <div class=\"options\">\n        <span class=\"option\">A. /; /</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">B. the; the</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">C. the; /</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">D. /; the</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <p class=\"prompt\">53. Mother would rather buy ______ these apples than get ______ bananas.</p>\n      <div class=\"options two-column\">\n        <span class=\"option\">A. three dozen of; scores of</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">B. three dozens of; scores of</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">C. three dozens; scores</span>\n        <span class=\"option\">D. three dozen; scores</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <p class=\"prompt\">54. ______ more you use a dictionary, ______ more